[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0253","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0253.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0811","title":"Mozilla Bugzilla SQL注入漏洞","description":"Bugzilla 的 buglist.cgi 脚本在处理 bug 列表的 sort order 排序参数时存在 SQL 注入漏洞。受影响版本包括 Bugzilla 2.14、2.14.1 及 2.16 至 2.16rc2。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 SQL 语句的 sort order 参数，向目标 Bugzilla 系统的 buglist.cgi 发送特制 HTTP 请求，触发 SQL 注入，进而执行未授权查询或造成拒绝服务。攻击无需预先获取凭据，仅需向目标系统发送携带注入载荷的 Web 请求即可利用该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0811"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:10Z","remediation":"立即将 Bugzilla 升级至 2.14.2 或 2.16rc2 及以上版本以修复 buglist.cgi 中 sort order 参数的 SQL 注入漏洞。升级前可临时在 Web 服务器层面对 /buglist.cgi 的 sort 参数进行输入过滤，仅允许字母数字字符，拒绝包含 SQL 关键字的请求。同时在数据库层面限制 Bugzilla 服务账户的权限，避免攻击者通过 SQL 注入执行任意查询或造成拒绝服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0054.html","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=130821","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4964","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d856f6c74dc5fe460aff45fba36c20f9dfe1a1dc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0811.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a575b8ac6bbfd9ccd952fc4125a0256374d44c93/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0811.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0811","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0811.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0811.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/681ca172eee6c5130c93c0a1b2ad5b47ddcc6020/2002/CVE-2002-0811.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/89eeaa8d7ef6ae24cbc356832e183d8519afcdb0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0811.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beba1b176cd5b7fd45b0085792055fbb0538d4d6/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0811.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/464c797de515f2d88fce07a24f8ad97207296c93/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0811.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0811.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0253.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0249","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0249.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0809","title":"Mozilla Bugzilla URL编码访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"Bugzilla 2.14 版本（2.14.2 之前）及 2.16 版本（2.16rc2 之前）存在权限绕过漏洞。由于系统未正确处理浏览器生成的 URL 编码字段名，当攻击者通过 buglist.cgi 提交包含 URL 编码字段名的 HTTP 请求时，某些字段会被错误识别为未设置状态，从而导致缺陷（bug）的组访问权限被意外移除。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用此漏洞，绕过 Bugzilla 的访问控制机制，获取本不应被授权的缺陷信息或执行未授权操作。该漏洞影响部署了受影响版本 Bugzilla 缺陷跟踪系统的组织，CVSS v3 评分 7.5，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0809"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:10Z","remediation":"升级 Bugzilla 至 2.14.2 或更高版本（2.16 分支升级至 2.16rc2 或更高版本），并应用官方补丁修复 URL 编码字段名解析问题。如无法立即升级，可配置 Web 服务器在转发请求前对 buglist.cgi 的 URL 参数进行解码预处理，确保浏览器传入的 %2D 格式字段名被正确识别。Red Hat 用户应安装 RHSA-2002:109 安全更新以修复受影响软件包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0054.html","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=148674","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10141.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-109.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4964","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/187f9782052f1b70e6e7a8a5791a57c9e8021979/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0809.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0809","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3919f5d4f46129b5d413845566be804f8af4ae72/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0809.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0809.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0809.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08ba152b02cd4c80943575986c4ffc5404b2becb/2002/CVE-2002-0809.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6e69f660565d27d937b8b70d75c3a224ecbcbcd3/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0809.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d478c26e0933f1b427dcee2764a288a5136f688f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0809.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c5d5eae73f592ddf4dd88ea1c5b9789d879f4ac6/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0809.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0809.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0249.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0249.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0248","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0248.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0808","title":"Mozilla Bugzilla 批量修改功能权限分配不当漏洞","description":"Bugzilla 批量修改功能存在权限绕过漏洞。当管理员执行批量修改（mass change）操作时，Bugzilla 会将第一个选中缺陷的 groupset（分组权限）错误地应用到所有选中缺陷上，而非保留每个缺陷原有的 groupset 设置。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统提交特制批量修改请求，利用该逻辑缺陷将某些敏感缺陷的权限组设置为不安全的访问控制配置，导致原本仅限特定用户组查看的机密缺陷信息被泄露给未授权用户。该漏洞影响 Bugzilla 2.14 至 2.14.2 之前版本以及 2.16 至 2.16rc2 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者只需具备网络访问权限即可利用，无需身份认证，成功利用可导致机密缺陷信息泄露及完整性破坏。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0808"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:10Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Bugzilla 2.14.2 或 2.16rc2 及更高版本。如暂不支持直接升级，可从 https://ftp.mozilla.org/pub/webtools/ 下载对应版本的补丁包（bugzilla-2.14.1-to-2.14.2.diff.gz）手动应用。临时缓解措施：在 Apache 配置的 httpd.conf 中禁用 HostnameLookups 选项（设为 Off），并在 Bugzilla 参数设置（params）中确认未启用反向 DNS 验证，以防止 mass change 操作过程中自定义的 groupset 权限被错误地覆盖到所有缺陷记录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0054.html","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=107718","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9305.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-109.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4964","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f135a3eefb271ec646bff9a246bc5fe22f8d215d/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0808.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1041b963fe09630259aeaf4c2267251b64209683/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0808.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0808","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0808.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0808.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6e362f6959b500f9e0530cd95885d05afaa93bae/2002/CVE-2002-0808.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6e69f660565d27d937b8b70d75c3a224ecbcbcd3/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0808.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/6a2b2a4b8df5513f296f3b55b8d745d51fd48baf/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0808.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c5d5eae73f592ddf4dd88ea1c5b9789d879f4ac6/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0808.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0808.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0248.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0247","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0247.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0807","title":"Mozilla Bugzilla editusers.cgi 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Bugzilla 2.14 至 2.14.1 及 2.16 早期版本中的 editusers.cgi 脚本存在跨站脚本漏洞。该脚本在处理用户真实姓名（full name）字段时未对输入进行充分的引号转义处理，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可以在真实姓名字段中注入恶意脚本代码。当管理员或其他用户通过浏览器访问编辑用户页面时，注入的脚本将在其浏览器上下文中执行，从而窃取会话令牌、执行未授权操作或篡改数据。该漏洞影响 Bugzilla 2.14 至 2.14.1 以及 2.16rc2 之前的版本，攻击者无需任何凭据即可远程发起攻击，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0807"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:10Z","remediation":"立即将 Bugzilla 升级至 2.14.2 或 2.16rc2 版本，这两个版本已修复 editusers.cgi 中对 real name 字段未正确转义的问题。如无法立即升级，可临时在 Web 服务器层面配置 HTML 实体编码，对所有用户提交的 real name 字段中的 `<`、`>`、`&`、`\"`、`'` 等特殊字符进行转义处理，以阻止脚本注入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0054.html","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=146447","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9304.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4964","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b328bc09980ed1c829df312deb1700fa6b961e03/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0807.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c3259b0cbf17b142c0e516420bc21bb303a8efff/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0807.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0807","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0807.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0807.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6e362f6959b500f9e0530cd95885d05afaa93bae/2002/CVE-2002-0807.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ee57928ec8c4e69e0336f659aed168c754588546/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0807.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/6a2b2a4b8df5513f296f3b55b8d745d51fd48baf/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0807.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c5d5eae73f592ddf4dd88ea1c5b9789d879f4ac6/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0807.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0807.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0247.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0244","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0244.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0806","title":"Bugzilla 未授权用户删除漏洞","description":"Bugzilla 2.14 版本低于 2.14.2 以及 2.16 版本低于 2.16rc2 存在权限控制缺陷。拥有编辑权限的已认证用户能够绕过正常用户管理界面的安全限制，直接通过访问 editusers.cgi 脚本并附加 \"del\" 参数的方式删除系统中的其他用户账户。该漏洞的利用过程无需额外权限或复杂操作，攻击者仅需构造包含删除参数的特定请求 URL 即可在未经授权的情况下删除任意用户，造成用户数据永久丢失和系统完整性破坏。受影响管理员可通过升级至 Bugzilla 2.14.2 或 2.16rc2 及更高版本修复此安全问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0806"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:10Z","remediation":"将Bugzilla升级至2.14.2或2.16rc2及以后版本，以修复editusers.cgi脚本中允许有编辑权限的用户删除其他用户的漏洞。如暂无法升级，可在Web服务器配置中限制editusers.cgi脚本仅对管理员用户可访问，或暂时禁用该脚本作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0054.html","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=141557","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9303.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5080","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-109.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4964","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6c59753dc6e5de3c597a526685e2e9874d6f653a/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0806.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0806","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/38158e6e901ddca3c8ee20ca9ec4743fea0a0aa4/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0806.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0806.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0806.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6e362f6959b500f9e0530cd95885d05afaa93bae/2002/CVE-2002-0806.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e1a268dc0e02b73f248a444c603b18f9e2934718/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0806.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/898047b0edf6969716a8399b5fa3114d532c7402/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0806.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c5d5eae73f592ddf4dd88ea1c5b9789d879f4ac6/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0806.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0806.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0244.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0243","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0243.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0805","title":"Bugzilla 不安全文件权限本地代码执行漏洞","description":"tags as requested.<value>Bugzilla 2.14 至 2.14.2 之前版本及 2.16 至 2.16rc2 之前版本存在权限配置不当漏洞。程序在创建新目录和 params 文件时将其设置为全局可写（world-writable），导致本地用户能够修改这些关键文件并执行任意代码。受影响系统包括运行 Bugzilla 2.14.x 和 2.16.x 系列的服务器，攻击者需先获得本地系统访问权限，利用该漏洞可进一步提升权限并完全控制目标系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0805"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:10Z","remediation":"升级 Bugzilla 至 2.14.2（2.14.x 分支）或 2.16rc2（2.16.x 分支）。修改 defparams.pl 中 WriteParams 函数的目录创建逻辑，移除对 data 目录的 chmod 777 操作，确保新创建目录和 params 文件不被赋予全局可写权限。同时检查 defparams.pl、globals.pl、importxml.pl 和 move.pl 中所有 chmod 调用，将文件权限修正为仅 Web 服务器用户可写。升级后须重新运行 checksetup.pl 以应用修复后的权限设置。临时缓解措施：以 Web 服务器用户身份手动将 data 目录和 params 文件权限设为 750 或 770，禁止全局用户写入访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0054.html","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=134575","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9302.php","http://www.osvdb.org/6395","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-109.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4964","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/85173a2e1318ed569ebbe0f7c0fd4da41967760d/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0805.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0805","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6392b489ed3a7669c609bae10325f1a166410f3/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0805.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0805.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0805.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6e362f6959b500f9e0530cd95885d05afaa93bae/2002/CVE-2002-0805.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e1a268dc0e02b73f248a444c603b18f9e2934718/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0805.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/898047b0edf6969716a8399b5fa3114d532c7402/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0805.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c5d5eae73f592ddf4dd88ea1c5b9789d879f4ac6/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0805.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0805.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0243.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0242","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0242.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0804","title":"Mozilla Bugzilla IP地址限制绕过漏洞","description":"Bugzilla 2.14 2.14.2之前版本及2.16 2.16rc2之前版本在配置了反向DNS解析功能时，存在安全绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可利用此漏洞，通过伪造反向DNS主机名的方式绕过基于IP地址的访问限制，未经授权访问受保护的Bugzilla系统。该漏洞影响启用了反向DNS查找功能的Bugzilla实例，攻击条件为攻击者能够控制其连接的反向DNS解析结果。CVSS评分为7.5，危害等级较高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0804"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:10Z","remediation":"将 Bugzilla 升级至 2.14.2 或更高版本（2.14 分支），或升级至 2.16rc2 或更高版本（2.16 分支），并运行 checksetup.pl 完成数据库结构升级（logincookies 表将改为存储 IP 地址）。如暂时无法升级，可在 Apache 配置中设置 HostnameLookups Off 以禁用反向 DNS 查询，从而阻断利用路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0054.html","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=129466","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9301.php","http://www.osvdb.org/6394","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-109.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4964","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d9173cb87ca4d6d199846d1d27516352b75d2c70/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0804.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0804","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ed49b018fbc876ac3a1cc53b206d35c44adb8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0804.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0804.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0804.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0804.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/094d6382e9f2b76e665247588266e58be890fb67/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0804.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/52ddd3fbe097d381a58d14aae3f8c42a9146b190/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0804.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c5d5eae73f592ddf4dd88ea1c5b9789d879f4ac6/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0804.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0804.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0242.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0240","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0240.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0803","title":"Mozilla Bugzilla queryhelp.cgi 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Bugzilla 2.14.2 之前版本及 2.16rc2 之前版本的 queryhelp.cgi 存在访问控制缺陷，远程未授权攻击者可直接发送 HTTP 请求访问该脚本，绕过权限检查查看受限的产品和组件信息。该漏洞影响 Bugzilla 2.14.x（<2.14.2）和 2.16.x（<2.16rc2）版本，CVSS 5.0 分（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N），攻击无需认证、网络可达即可利用，攻击者只需构造针对 queryhelp.cgi 的 HTTP 请求即可获取受限产品/组件信息，属于信息泄露类漏洞。官方已在 2.14.2 和 2.16rc2 版本中修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0803"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:09Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Bugzilla 至 2.14.2 或 2.16rc2 及以上版本。若暂无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache）配置访问控制规则，禁止对 queryhelp.cgi 的直接 HTTP 访问，或在 Bugzilla 配置中限制 queryhelp.cgi 的访问权限仅允许授权用户访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0054.html","http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=126801","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9300.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4964","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0803.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0803","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0803.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0803.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0803.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0803.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/094d6382e9f2b76e665247588266e58be890fb67/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0803.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0803.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c5d5eae73f592ddf4dd88ea1c5b9789d879f4ac6/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0803.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0803.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0240.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0240.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0238","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0238.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0802","title":"PostgreSQL 6.5.x SQL_ASCII编码多字节字符SQL注入漏洞","description":"PostgreSQL 6.5.x 在使用 SQL_ASCII 编码的多字节字符支持中，处理无法转换的字符时会多消耗一个字符，导致查询中的转义字符被意外移除，进而绕过输入验证和转义机制，使应用程序暴露于 SQL 注入攻击风险中。该漏洞影响运行 SQL_ASCII 编码的 PostgreSQL 6.5.x 版本，攻击者可通过构造特制的多字节字符序列注入恶意 SQL 语句，造成数据库数据泄露、篡改或删除。攻击前提是应用使用 SQL_ASCII 编码且未妥善处理多字节字符转换，攻击者可通过构造恶意输入触发注入。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0802"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:09Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 PostgreSQL 至 7.1.3 或更高版本（建议升级至当前长期支持版本如 16.x/15.x/14.x/13.x/12.x），并将数据库编码从 SQL_ASCII 迁移至 UTF-8。升级前请完整备份数据库，升级后需重建数据库并指定 UTF-8 编码（initdb -E UTF8），再恢复数据。若无法立即升级，临时缓解措施：在应用层严格使用参数化查询/预处理语句，严禁拼接 SQL 字符串；在数据库层面启用 standard_conforming_strings = on 并禁用 escape_string_warning 规避转义字符被吞噬风险；配置防火墙限制数据库端口（默认 5432）仅允许应用服务器 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=postgresql-general&m=102032794322362","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10328.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-149.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0802.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0802.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0802","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0802.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0802.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0802.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0802.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/094d6382e9f2b76e665247588266e58be890fb67/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0802.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c5d5eae73f592ddf4dd88ea1c5b9789d879f4ac6/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0802.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0802.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0238.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0236","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0236.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0728","title":"libpng libpng 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"libpng 库的渐进式读取器在处理 PNG 数据流时，未正确校验 IDAT 数据块的实际长度与 IHDR 头部声明长度是否一致，导致缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞影响 libpng 1.2.x 版本（1.2.4 之前）及 1.0.x 版本（1.0.14 之前），广泛用于各类图像处理软件、浏览器及图形库中。远程未认证攻击者可通过网络传播恶意构造的 PNG 文件，使 IDAT 数据量超出 IHDR 声明长度，诱导受害者使用受影响库解析图片，触发缓冲区溢出导致程序崩溃，造成拒绝服务攻击。攻击无需用户交互即可触发，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），影响可用性。升级至 libpng 1.2.4 或 1.0.14 及以上版本可修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0728"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:01Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 libpng 至 1.2.4 或更高版本（1.2.x 分支），或升级至 1.0.14 或更高版本（1.0.x 分支）。若无法立即升级，可在应用层禁用渐进式 PNG 解析功能，或配置图像处理库拒绝处理不受信的 PNG 文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000512","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-152.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-140","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-049.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0728.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0728.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0728","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0728.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0728.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0728.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/094d6382e9f2b76e665247588266e58be890fb67/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0728.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0728.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c5d5eae73f592ddf4dd88ea1c5b9789d879f4ac6/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0728.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0728.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0236.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0222","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0222.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0660","title":"libpng 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"libpng 在处理 PNG 图像时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于程序对用户提供的 PNG 文件数据长度缺乏充分校验，攻击者可通过向目标系统提交特制的畸形 PNG 图像文件触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而造成拒绝服务或可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Debian GNU/Linux 3.0 等系统上运行的 libpng 1.0.12-3.woody.2 及 libpng3 1.2.1-1.1.woody.2 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0660"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:53Z","remediation":"升级 libpng 至修复版本：Debian 用户升级 libpng 至 1.0.12-4、libpng3 至 1.2.1-2（参考 DSA-140）；Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2002:151 和 RHSA-2002:152 提供的更新包。其他系统用户应联系厂商获取对应补丁。如无法立即升级，建议在网络层面限制对受影响服务的访问以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-151.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-152.html","https://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-140","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0660.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0660.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0660","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0660.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0660.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-06xx/CVE-2002-0660.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0660.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0660.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/e7393e4662b98c582439177871aa2228c548d9c4/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0660.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0660.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0222.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0213","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0213.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0638","title":"Red Hat Linux util-linux setpwnam 竞态条件本地权限提升漏洞","description":"util-linux 软件包中的 setpwnam.c 函数在修改 /etc/passwd 文件时未正确锁定临时文件，存在竞争条件漏洞。本地攻击者可通过 chfn、chsh 等工具程序利用已打开的文件描述符发起复杂的竞争条件攻击，从而提升至 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 7.3 及更早版本以及其他使用 util-linux 的操作系统，CVSS 评分 6.2，攻击复杂度较高，需要本地访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0638"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:50Z","remediation":"立即升级 util-linux 软件包至修复版本。Red Hat Linux 用户应参照 RHSA-2002:132（适用于 6.2/7.0/7.1）或 RHSA-2002:137（适用于 Enterprise Linux 2.1）安全公告，通过 up2date 或 rpm 更新 util-linux 软件包。其他发行版用户应联系厂商获取对应补丁或升级至包含修复的 util-linux 2.11y 及以上版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0357.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0396.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000523","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102795787713996&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4320","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-132.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9709.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/405955","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-047.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5164","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-137.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5344","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0638.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0638","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0638.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9b61e147dd97f8b10bc28655d49bf9e6a89e79e2/2002/CVE-2002-0638.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0638.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0638.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0638.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0638.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-06xx/CVE-2002-0638.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-redhat/blob/11f7040c1ab8cb698a7a4a3c32a4afb6398c9ff1/2002/CVE-2002-0638.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0213.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0207","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0207.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0510","title":"Linux Kernel 2.4 UDP IP标识符固定为0信息泄露漏洞","description":"Linux 2.4.x 内核的 UDP 协议实现在发送非分片数据包时将 IP 标识（ID）字段固定为 0，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送探测数据包并观察返回的 IP ID 值来识别目标操作系统类型。该漏洞利用方式简单，无需认证即可远程触发，可被用于信息收集阶段以辅助后续针对性攻击。影响所有运行 Linux 2.4 系列内核的系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0510"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:34Z","remediation":"升级至 Linux 内核 2.6.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 IP ID 字段固定为 0 的问题，改为随机化生成。对于无法升级内核的旧系统，可配置 iptables 规则限制外部 UDP 探测流量，或使用网络层防火墙过滤可疑的 UDP 探测包作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8588.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/262840","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4314","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0510.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0510","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0510.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/9e840c51f12aff4a18b8c50d63ae898b6e33f403/references/CVE-2002-0510-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0510.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/81f67ee2f2329d45fd70316a977698f2177074cc/2002/CVE-2002-0510.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0510.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0510.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0510.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0510.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0207.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0206","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0497","title":"mtr 缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"mtr 0.46 及更早版本在安装为 setuid root 时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 MTR_OPTIONS 环境变量传入超长字符串触发该溢出，从而获取原始套接字访问权限。该漏洞影响 mtr 0.46 及之前版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。建议升级至 mtr 0.54 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0497"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:33Z","remediation":"升级 mtr 至 0.54 或更高版本，该版本已包含 CVE-2002-0497 的补丁。如无法立即升级，可临时移除 mtr 的 setuid root 权限（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/mtr），以消除本地提权风险，但会限制普通用户使用 mtr 的 raw socket 功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-03/0048.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-124","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8367.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4217","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0497.json","https://github.com/repoforge/rpms/blob/82e29d5def2823523ac2c472c0a6620b0d774d40/specs/mtr/mtr-0.54-CVE-2002-0497.patch","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0497.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-200